# Cross-origin isolation lets the OCR worker run ONNX Runtime WASM with threads. The worker script
# needs the same headers, so they cover every path. credentialless keeps API and portrait responses
# loadable without adding Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy to them.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: credentialless

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
